{
  "name": "@recruitment/dsh-recruitment",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "DSH 招聘工具包（32 个工具（30 + email_fetch + criterion_override）：30 个既有工具 + recruitment_email_fetch + recruitment_criterion_override；29 个 recruitment_* + 高层 record_human_decision，S3–S10 一条 Golden Path）：读写简历/结构化、一等业务读（申请/材料）、岗位与 Rubric（含人类批准入口）、S6 接入、S7 初筛、S8 排期（D-62 四 intent）、S9 转写、S10 面评与决策（含「记录人已做的决定」高层动作）、阶段推进、执行追溯、企业自建配置、邮箱收件、逐条 Rubric 标准人工纠偏（append-only，不改 AI 原判）；读写真连 PostgreSQL 17。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "src/index.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.ts",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsdown",
    "test": "node test/run-all.mjs",
    "test:serial": "node test/run-all.mjs --test-concurrency=1",
    "test:unit": "node --test \"test/unit/*.test.ts\" \"test/tools/*.test.ts\" \"test/contracts/*.test.ts\" \"test/structure/*.test.ts\" \"test/document/*.test.ts\" \"test/regression/*.test.ts\"",
    "test:db": "node --test \"test/integration/*.test.ts\" \"test/acceptance/*.test.ts\" \"test/runtime/*.test.ts\""
  },
  "files": [
    "src/**/*.ts",
    "lib/client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "CONTRACT.md",
    "skill/**"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "recruitment",
    "agent-tool"
  ],
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "4.1.0",
    "imapflow": "^2.12.1",
    "mailparser": "^3.14.5",
    "nodemailer": "^10.6.0",
    "pg": "^8.23.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "22.20.0",
    "@types/nodemailer": "^8.0.2",
    "@types/pg": "8.15.5",
    "@types/react": "18.3.28",
    "tsdown": "0.22.14",
    "typescript": "6.0.3"
  }
}
